l":"https://api.github.com/users/microsoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/microsoft/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","description":"C++ Library Manager for Windows, Linux, and MacOS","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/deployments","created_at":"2016-09-15T16:40:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T05:34:58Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:27:24Z","git_url":"git://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:microsoft/vcpkg.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg","homepage":"","size":96040,"stargazers_count":26254,"watchers_count":26254,"language":"CMake","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":7235,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1320,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c","cmake","cplusplus","cpp","libraries","package-manager","packages","vcpkg","visual-studio","windows"],"visibility":"public","forks":7235,"open_issues":1320,"watchers":26254,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Commit 14514508d8d30bdbd645b2bec89696aec25497f1 seems really problematic. While being able to edit these properties in the VS GUI is awesome, the issues it is causing are serious to enough to justify reverting until they  are addressed.\r\n\r\nIf I have an existing project with `VcpkgTriplet` set in the `.vcxproj` as the documentation suggests, then before the commit, `vcpkg` respects that triplet. After, it does not. Additionally, there are other bits of wonky behavior I'm seeing, depending on machine and VS version.\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\nReproduced as follows. Imagine happens on VS2017 as well.\r\n- OS: Windows 1903, Windows 1909\r\n- Compiler: VS2015, VS2019\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n- Begin by creating a vcpkg install right before the commit. We'll install the \"minhook\" package just to have something to include. From powershell, run\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg.git vcpkg_before\r\ncd vcpkg_before\r\ngit checkout 14514508d8d30bdbd645b2bec89696aec25497f1~1\r\n.\\bootstrap-vcpkg.bat\r\n.\\vcpkg.exe integrate install\r\n.\\vcpkg.exe install minhook:x86-windows-static\r\n```\r\n- Leave powershell open.\r\n- Now start visual studio (reproduced with 2015 and 2019), create a new c++ console application project with solution, and then edit the `.vcxproj` project file to have the line:\r\n`<VcpkgTriplet>x86-windows-static</VcpkgTriplet>`\r\nat the bottom of the\r\n`<PropertyGroup Label=\"Globals\">`\r\nsection. Reload the project when visual studio prompts. Then add\r\n`#include \"minhook.h\"`\r\nimmediately before the main() function.\r\n- Build the solution. It will succeed.\r\n- Now close visual studio. We will now move to vcpkg with the problematic commit.\r\nGo back to powershell in vcpkg_before and run the following commands:\r\n```\r\n.\\vcpkg.exe integrate remove\r\ncd ..\r\ngit clone https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg.git vcpkg_after\r\ncd vcpkg_after\r\ngit checkout 14514508d8d30bdbd645b2bec89696aec25497f1\r\n.\\bootstrap-vcpkg.bat\r\n.\\vcpkg.exe integrate install\r\n.\\vcpkg.exe install minhook:x86-windows-static\r\n```\r\n- Now launch visual studio and open the previous solution. Rebuild the solution. It fails.\r\n- Note that the build output specifies that it is using `x86-windows` even though the project file specifies `x86-windows-static`.\r\n- In VS2015 only, if you move the\r\n`<VcpkgTriplet>x86-windows-static</VcpkgTriplet>`\r\nline in the vcxproj to the \"Configuration\" PropertyGroup for Debug|Win32, it will then use \"x86-windows-static\", which is correct, but from the wrong location \"C:\\vckpg_after\\installed\\x86-windows\\\", and still fail.\r\n- On a non-clean windows image (my dev machine with a slightly older VS2015 Update 3 (14.0.25425.01), the behavior is even wonkier. In that scenario, the triplet in the property page is defaulted to \"$(PlatformTarget)-$(VcpkgOSTarget)\" and building with `vcpkg_after` outputs\r\n`\"Using triplet \"-windows\" from \"F:\\vcpkg\\installed\\-windows\\\"`\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nUpdating to the latest vcpkg should not break existing working projects\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/12062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/12062/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3489695819,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQzNDg5Njk1ODE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/3489695819","actor":{"login":"JackBoosY","id":47264268,"node_id":"MDQ